cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use RAPID in your research, please cite the paper listed under
  preferred-citation. For the physical background and dead-zone model,
  also cite the paper listed under references. Record the software release
  or commit used for your calculation.
type: software
title: "RAPID: Representative Approach for Particle-Integrated Disks"
authors:
